# Agent Portal — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.

# Supabase project (Settings -> API in the Supabase dashboard)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Until both values above are set, auth is disabled and all routes are open
# (see lib/supabase/middleware.ts). Set them to turn on Microsoft SSO gating.

# Microsoft (Entra ID) SSO is configured in the Supabase dashboard, not here:
#   Authentication -> Providers -> Azure
#   - Azure Client ID / Secret come from the Entra app registration
#   - Add redirect URL:  https://<project-ref>.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#   - Restrict to your tenant via the Azure provider's "Azure Tenant URL"
